    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Musculocutaneous nerve supply:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " coracobrachialis, biceps brachii and brachialis; the shoulder and elbow joints; skin of the lateral forearm."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
