      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Cubital tunnel:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " the ulnar nerve can be compressed where it runs under the medial epicondyle through the cubital tunnel (cubital tunnel syndrome)."
     }
